        "text": "Do Babies Taste Food in the Womb? Medically Reviewed by Shannon Smith, M.D.",
        "text_sha256": "4f18d8ff7566911f19796ee6e1c33a88e1e3ddd3aa97a3223ff5f5aad72851e4",
